{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arthur's Thinking Games is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 6 different fun-filled activities and 5 levels of difficulty, Arthur's Thinking Games will entertain your child with hours of learning and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn with Arthur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on Arthur\u2019s friends to go to a learning activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fun Facts &amp; Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn facts and words with Francine, Muffy and Buster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logic &amp; Memory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use logic and memory to get the mummy out of the pyramid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critical Thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memory Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Problem Solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creativity Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patterns &amp; Sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Geography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">History</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art &amp; Music Activities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461500?t=1741045610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461500/a2e7343e06926d37c679c35ad331b7a792ffa4f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741045610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461500/4b46b4c4c09d52106ea1fb2ef428b381d839d5c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741045610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i